  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T V.254 is applicable to the interconnection of multi-functional communication devices (such as mobile phones) with devices intended to provide assistive capabilities for those communication devices. It defines a range of serial binary commands that comply to the format and general rules of Recommendation ITU-T V.250 via a range of suitable interfaces.</abstract>
